<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .header {
            color: #0d9488;
        }

        .notice {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            padding: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid #0d9488;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="header">Registration Received, <%= fullName %>!</h2>
        <p>Thank you for registering <strong>
                <%= companyName %>
            </strong> on CodeShift.</p>
        <div class="notice">
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Your email is verified. Your company registration (ID:
                <code><%= businessRegistrationNo %></code>) is currently <strong>under admin review</strong>. You will
                be notified once approved to post jobs.</p>
        </div>
        <p>Best regards,<br>The CodeShift Team</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>